Description: Provides functions to estimate between-case incidence rate ratios (IRR) using Generalized Estimating Equations (GEE). Designed specifically for across-participants multiple baseline single-case experimental designs (SCED) with small sample sizes, implementing corrections such as the Kauermann-Carroll method. Includes the 'OtaDuPaul2002' dataset for demonstration.
